[[file:Attribute speed icon.png|50px]]
'''Speed''' determines how quickly the character moves and is represented by a shoe. Speed has a minimum value of 0.1 and a maximum value of 2.0.

{{dlc|nr}} Some items may lower the maximum value, and other items may bring it back up, but it can never exceed 2.0.

