=== Other ===
* Speed up [[pill]]s increase speed by 0.15, and speed down pills decrease speed by 0.12.
* The {{tf|Spun}} transformation increases speed by 0.15.
* {{dlc|a}} In co-op, [[Co-op#Special Babies 2|Yellow Baby]] will occasionally briefly increase speed by 0.15. [[Co-op#Special Babies 2|Whore Baby]] will occasionally briefly grant the {{I|Whore of Babylon}} effect, which increases speed. [[Co-op#Special Babies 2|Dark Baby]] will occasionally briefly increase all stats, including speed.
* The {{P|III - The Empress}} card activates the {{I|Whore of Babylon}} effect for the current room, which increases speed.
* The {{P|XI - Strength}} card activates the {{I|Magic Mushroom}} effect for the current room, which increases speed.
* The {{P|VII - The Chariot}} card activates the {{I|My Little Unicorn}} effect for the current room, which increases speed.
* {{dlc|a+}} The {{P|Era Walk|dlc=x}} card increases speed and decreases shot speed for the current room.
* {{dlc|a+}} The [[Feels like I'm walking on sunshine!]] pill activates the {{i|Unicorn Stump}} effect for the current room, which increases speed.
* {{dlc|a+}} Absorbing an item using {{p|Black Rune|n}} can increase speed by 0.2.
* {{p|Soul of Judas}} activates the {{i|Dark Arts|n}} effect, which increases speed.
* {{p|Soul of Samson}} activates the {{i|Berserk!|n}} effect, which increases speed.
* {{p|III - The Empress?}} card decreases speed by 0.1 for the duration of its effect.
* {{p|XII - The Hanged Man?}} card decreases speed by 0.1 for the duration of its effect.

